-<p>A CockroachDB cluster can answer SQL while operating outside the boundary you intended. An application may be connected as an administrator. A range may still have a majority, but no room for another failure. In both cases a successful query is real evidence, but it answers a smaller question than “is this service safe to depend on?”</p>
+<p>A CockroachDB cluster can answer SQL while operating outside the boundary you intended. An application may be connected as an administrator. The next server failure may make some of its data unavailable. In both cases a successful query is real evidence, but it answers a smaller question than “is this service safe to depend on?”</p>
 <p>Operating the cluster means checking those boundaries before an incident makes them matter. Follow two changes to the shop: give its catalogue runtime a secure, limited identity, then permanently remove a node. The examples use CockroachDB 25.4.17. The security fixture uses the explicit tenant-scoped variant: shop 10 has the Blue mug, P7 at 20.00; shop 20 has a different P7, the Copper mug at 18.00.</p>
 
